
Welcome to Alpine Linux 3.24, running in your browser.

Type a command you don't have and it is installed from Alpine's packages, then
run: python3, htop, lua5.4, nano, git... Or install them yourself with apk:
  apk add python3 htop
What you change is kept in this browser.

The demo network reaches Alpine's package server (dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org) and
nothing else. Its budget, and what you have used of it:
  curl http://192.168.127.1/status

